  "details": "Allow VRChat mobile players to essentially hold their phone and have their avatar in VRC mimic that movement. \n\nTurning on this \"immersive\" mode for the VRC camera would make their avatar hold their own phone prop and moving their phone around in real life will make the avatar also rotate around in VRC via their phone's gyroscope. There would be an option to use their phone's back facing camera or their front facing camera for immersive selfies. This would just flip their camera's view on their screen. \n\nThis could allow a sense of augmented reality for mobile users as it would be like they were taking photos of a virtual world and their avatars within it using their real phone.",
